From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zaid <nottzaid@tutamail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 01:34:50 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 11/12] miles-bench cmdreplay: review fixes

Interop (GetVulkanHandle, BeginVkCommandBufferInterop) gets the real handle after a drain; later
devices fill entry points the first device lacked; vkDestroyDevice waits for queued destroys;
queued destroys use exact-size chunks and the chunk free list is capped; guards skip NULL handles
(vkDestroyPipelineCache(NULL) on every PSO release waited for the worker); vkFreeMemory is no
longer held back (VRAM goes back at once; frees follow GPU completion, so their ops were replayed);
push descriptor copies follow descriptorType; OOM unlink fix; the generator fails on procs without
a prototype.
---
 libs/vkd3d/cmdreplay.c              | 113 ++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 libs/vkd3d/cmdreplay_gen.h          |  53 ++++---------
 libs/vkd3d/cmdreplay_gen.py         |  10 ++-
 libs/vkd3d/command_list_vkd3d_ext.c |   3 +-
 libs/vkd3d/device_vkd3d_ext.c       |   3 +-
 libs/vkd3d/vkd3d_private.h          |   1 +
 6 files changed, 125 insertions(+), 58 deletions(-)

diff --git a/libs/vkd3d/cmdreplay.c b/libs/vkd3d/cmdreplay.c
